---
// Methodology.astro - The 4-Stage Algorithmic Architecture
---

<section id="methodology" class="py-24 bg-[#171A20] text-white scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1380px] mx-auto px-6">
    <!-- Header Block -->
    <div class="max-w-[800px] mb-20">
      <span class="text-[12px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-[#3E6AE1] uppercase block mb-2">
        The VALENCE Framework
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-[32px] md:text-[38px] font-medium leading-[1.2] text-white text-balance">
        Four Stages of Engineered Growth
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] text-white/70 leading-[1.6] text-pretty">
        We replaced traditional agency guesswork with an iterative, empirical growth architecture modeled after modern software deployment cycles.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4-Stage Sequence conforming to DESIGN.md -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      <!-- Stage 1 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-[8px] bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[13px] font-mono text-[#3E6AE1] block mb-6">STAGE 01</span>
          <h3 class="text-[20px] font-medium text-white mb-3">
            Algorithmic Deconstruction
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[14px] text-white/70 leading-[1.6] mb-6">
            We analyze your historical customer data, reverse-engineer competing ad velocity, and audit platform distribution signals to identify untapped attention arbitrage.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-4 text-[12px] text-white/50 space-y-1">
          <div>&bull; Creative Exhaustion Audit</div>
          <div>&bull; Audience Affinity Mapping</div>
          <div>&bull; 30-Day Growth Benchmark</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 2 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-[8px] bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[13px] font-mono text-[#3E6AE1] block mb-6">STAGE 02</span>
          <h3 class="text-[20px] font-medium text-white mb-3">
            Creative Velocity Matrix
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[14px] text-white/70 leading-[1.6] mb-6">
            Our in-house production team shoots and edits 40+ modular variations weekly. We test multiple opening 3-second hooks, body narratives, visual paces, and CTAs.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-4 text-[12px] text-white/50 space-y-1">
          <div>&bull; Studio & UGC Modular Kits</div>
          <div>&bull; High-Velocity A/B Testing</div>
          <div>&bull; Retention-Optimized Audio</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 3 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-[8px] bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[13px] font-mono text-[#3E6AE1] block mb-6">STAGE 03</span>
          <h3 class="text-[20px] font-medium text-white mb-3">
            Full-Funnel Paid Scaling
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[14px] text-white/70 leading-[1.6] mb-6">
            Winning creative combinations are deployed into broad algorithmic bidding structures. Budget automatically scales into high-converting audience clusters.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-4 text-[12px] text-white/50 space-y-1">
          <div>&bull; Cost Cap & Bid Optimization</div>
          <div>&bull; Cross-Platform Liquidity</div>
          <div>&bull; Omnichannel Retargeting</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 4 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-[8px] bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <span class="text-[13px] font-mono text-[#3E6AE1] block mb-6">STAGE 04</span>
          <h3 class="text-[20px] font-medium text-white mb-3">
            Attribution & LTV Expansion
          </h3>
          <p class="text-[14px] text-white/70 leading-[1.6] mb-6">
            Server-side tracking and triple-attribution analytics provide clear visibility into cohort retention, payback windows, and customer lifetime value.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-4 text-[12px] text-white/50 space-y-1">
          <div>&bull; First-Party Data Capture</div>
          <div>&bull; Cohort Payback Dashboards</div>
          <div>&bull; Weekly Executive Briefings</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
